THIRD-PARTY DATA

The dedication above covers this project's own source code. The two
generated files in data/ derive from upstream datasets that carry
their own terms, which this dedication cannot override:

  data/land.json    Coastlines from Natural Earth by way of
                    topojson/world-atlas. Natural Earth is in the
                    public domain, so no conditions attach.

  data/cities.json  City names, coordinates and timezones from
                    kevinroberts/city-timezones (MIT), whose data
                    derives in turn from SimpleMaps' World Cities
                    Basic database, released under CC BY 4.0.
                    ATTRIBUTION IS REQUIRED when redistributing this
                    file or a work built from it. See the Attribution
                    section of README.md.

